WEBVTT

00:02.690 --> 00:04.950
"To the one reading this:"

00:04.950 --> 00:07.900
"The fact that you can read this 
text written in Japanese means..."

00:08.200 --> 00:11.780
<i>...that you have also come 
here from the other world.</i>

00:12.620 --> 00:16.160
<i>My name is Yuuya Terra Hirasawa Esfort.</i>

00:17.110 --> 00:20.620
<i>I am this nation's first king,
 and I am Japanese.</i>

00:20.900 --> 00:22.080
So it's true!

00:22.080 --> 00:26.470
<i>I have decided to write my account 
of how I came to this world.</i>

00:27.130 --> 00:30.500
<i>I was involved in an accident 
in Japan and thought I had died,</i>

00:30.500 --> 00:32.380
<i>but I was summoned to this world.</i>

00:32.380 --> 00:36.820
<i>So unlike me, he came here 
in his original form?</i>

00:36.820 --> 00:38.510
Master Cain!

00:36.820 --> 00:38.510
Cain!

00:40.810 --> 00:42.240
What are you doing?

00:42.240 --> 00:43.780
Teles... Silk...

00:43.780 --> 00:44.810
Oh, I know!

00:44.810 --> 00:48.440
The academy entrance exams are 
coming up, so you're studying!

00:48.440 --> 00:49.570
Is that right?

00:49.860 --> 00:50.870
Huh?

00:50.870 --> 00:52.960
Oh! Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:52.960 --> 00:55.740
Maybe I'll study with you.

00:55.740 --> 00:57.410
I want to study with him, too!

00:59.040 --> 01:02.550
Sorry! I don't have time to 
hang out with you two today!

01:02.550 --> 01:04.200
I have things to do...

01:04.200 --> 01:05.650
Tomorrow, then?

01:05.650 --> 01:07.080
Tomorrow's even worse!

01:07.420 --> 01:08.550
But why?

01:08.550 --> 01:10.250
Sorry... Sorry...

01:10.250 --> 01:12.480
Some other time!

01:11.080 --> 01:12.480
Master Cain, wait!

01:12.480 --> 01:14.800
When is "some other time"?!

01:15.870 --> 01:18.300
My dear husband!

01:18.720 --> 01:19.180
Ti...

01:19.180 --> 01:20.420
Tijuana!

01:20.420 --> 01:24.560
Perfect timing! Want to have a mock 
battle outside the capital tomorrow?

01:24.560 --> 01:25.930
Tomorrow?!

01:25.930 --> 01:27.570
Do you have plans or something?

01:27.570 --> 01:30.760
Sorry! Some other time!

01:29.810 --> 01:32.900
Dear husband! When is "some other time"?!

01:33.310 --> 01:35.980
<i>Sorry! Sorry, everyone!</i>

01:36.360 --> 01:40.030
<i>Today is a very important day for me.</i>

01:40.890 --> 01:43.350
<i>It's my twelfth birthday!</i>

01:43.990 --> 01:47.530
<i>The day I finally get to 
register as an adventurer!</i>

01:48.740 --> 01:50.760
<i>Ever since I was little,</i>

01:50.760 --> 01:54.980
<i>I've been training with tutors so 
I could be an adventurer someday.</i>

01:54.980 --> 01:57.020
<i>I reincarnated here as a noble...</i>

01:58.680 --> 02:02.580
<i>But that's a secret to everyone!</i>

02:13.150 --> 02:16.030
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

03:33.500 --> 03:37.840
"Cain, the Rookie Adventurer"

03:33.500 --> 03:37.840
"Cain, the Rookie Adventurer"

03:39.970 --> 03:42.410
<i>I knew the royal capital's 
guild would be amazing!</i>

03:42.410 --> 03:44.930
<i>It's so big and exciting!</i>

03:46.600 --> 03:48.870
What's up, kid? First time here?

03:48.870 --> 03:51.420
Yes! I've finally turned twelve,

03:51.420 --> 03:53.120
so I'm here to register as an adventurer!

03:53.490 --> 03:57.210
Yeah? Well, just remember, 
you've only got one life.

03:57.210 --> 03:58.730
Don't do anything too crazy.

03:59.800 --> 04:03.510
I feel like I've seen that red hair before...

04:07.210 --> 04:10.060
Welcome to the Royal Capital 
Guild Headquarters.

04:10.060 --> 04:12.070
You're here to register as an adventurer?

04:12.070 --> 04:12.820
Yes!

04:14.520 --> 04:17.650
Please fill in the required 
fields on this form.

04:18.080 --> 04:20.530
<i>Let's see... My name is Cain...</i>

04:20.960 --> 04:24.500
<i>Wait, should I write the "baron" part?</i>

04:24.500 --> 04:27.110
<i>That doesn't have anything to do 
with being an adventurer, though.</i>

04:27.110 --> 04:28.890
<i>Just "Cain" should be enough.</i>

04:30.370 --> 04:32.300
Does that look okay?

04:34.610 --> 04:36.080
Yes, looks good.

04:36.340 --> 04:39.550
Now I'll need you to place a drop 
of your blood on this crystal.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.770
My blood?

04:41.880 --> 04:47.160
Yes, it will register your magic 
capacity on your guild card.

04:47.530 --> 04:50.290
You'll start at G-rank.

04:53.350 --> 04:54.570
Come to think of it...

04:54.570 --> 04:57.970
My instructors said they 
were D-rank, didn't they?

04:58.350 --> 05:00.690
I wonder what they're up to now.

05:00.950 --> 05:04.410
If anything is unclear to you, 
feel free to ask questions at any time.

05:04.410 --> 05:06.590
Thank you, ma'am!

05:06.960 --> 05:10.700
Oh, I'm sorry! My name is Retia.

05:10.700 --> 05:12.660
It's nice to meet you, Sir Cain.

05:13.000 --> 05:16.420
There's no need for "Sir." I'm only twelve.

05:16.420 --> 05:17.890
Just my name, please.

05:17.890 --> 05:22.480
I see. Well, then, I wish you luck, Cain.

05:22.480 --> 05:25.160
Oh, but remember that your life is valuable.

05:25.160 --> 05:25.910
I will!

05:27.520 --> 05:29.090
Hey, Retia!

05:29.090 --> 05:31.930
Ditch the brat and come hang out with us.

05:31.930 --> 05:35.210
We'll keep you company 
all through the night.

05:37.140 --> 05:39.610
<i>This again?</i>

05:39.610 --> 05:43.980
What's this? Be a good little kid 
and stay home helping your mommy!

05:44.570 --> 05:47.010
He dodged that like a real man!

05:47.010 --> 05:49.160
Looks like this kid needs some education!

05:51.080 --> 05:52.520
What the hell are you doing?!

05:52.520 --> 05:54.670
That's what I should be asking you.

05:54.670 --> 05:55.790
Get him!

05:57.790 --> 05:59.120
Keep still, damn it!

05:59.770 --> 06:00.540
Wait!

06:00.540 --> 06:01.930
If you draw that...

06:01.930 --> 06:04.800
Hey, you guys. 
What're you doing to a little kid?

06:05.710 --> 06:07.690
The red-haired guy from earlier!

06:07.690 --> 06:09.180
Th-The guy from Ice Flame...

06:09.580 --> 06:11.180
Claude!

06:11.180 --> 06:13.550
If you wanna fight someone that bad...

06:13.550 --> 06:16.390
I'll fight you. All through the night.

06:18.170 --> 06:20.420
Let's go! Better remember our faces, brat!

06:21.690 --> 06:23.400
What a cliché.

06:24.560 --> 06:27.200
Thank you so much, Sir Claude!

06:27.710 --> 06:30.030
I appreciate your helping me out.

06:30.330 --> 06:33.370
Don't worry about it. 
I stopped them for their own good.

06:33.770 --> 06:37.610
I can tell from the way you 
moved that you're pretty strong.

06:37.610 --> 06:38.380
What's your name?

06:38.740 --> 06:40.920
Cain. My name is Cain.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.080
Cain, huh?

06:42.410 --> 06:44.040
I'll remember that.

06:45.610 --> 06:46.730
I like you!

06:46.730 --> 06:49.530
Join me for a drink in return 
for that great show you put on.

06:52.250 --> 06:54.830
Fruit juice for you, 
since you're still a kid.

06:59.190 --> 07:02.660
Anyway, you're pretty 
well-trained, aren't ya?

07:02.660 --> 07:04.730
Your evasive moves were incredibly efficient.

07:05.230 --> 07:07.940
It takes a lot of practice 
to pull off moves like those.

07:08.790 --> 07:11.360
I've been training since I was very little.

07:11.360 --> 07:14.030
I had tutors who were adventurers.

07:14.030 --> 07:16.060
Huh? Tutors?

07:16.060 --> 07:18.680
Nah, couldn't be. Never mind.

07:18.680 --> 07:21.470
Here's to the promising new 
adventurer I just met today!

07:21.470 --> 07:22.830
Cheers!

07:27.370 --> 07:32.130
By the way, Claude, that guy earlier 
said you're with the "Ice Flame."

07:32.440 --> 07:35.680
Yeah, Ice Flame is the name of my party.

07:35.680 --> 07:39.400
I use a flame sword, 
and my wife uses ice magic,

07:39.400 --> 07:41.140
so the name kinda came naturally.

07:41.140 --> 07:44.100
Wow, you're in a party with your wife?

07:44.340 --> 07:48.540
You should find a trustworthy party 
to work with as soon as you can.

07:48.540 --> 07:51.030
Then you can take on the big quests,

07:51.030 --> 07:52.880
and your rank will go up quickly.

07:52.880 --> 07:53.860
Like this.

07:56.030 --> 07:58.410
Wow! A gold card!

07:58.410 --> 08:00.880
That means you're A-rank, doesn't it?!

08:00.880 --> 08:05.630
Yeah, but I'm still a far cry from our 
first king, who was apparently SSS-rank.

08:05.630 --> 08:07.370
It's still amazing!

08:08.340 --> 08:10.010
There's still a long way to go, though!

08:10.430 --> 08:12.530
SSS-rank, huh?

08:12.530 --> 08:16.000
Yep. I hear the SSS-rank card is black.

08:16.000 --> 08:18.420
Of course, gold looks a lot cooler, though!

08:18.420 --> 08:19.300
Ow!

08:20.160 --> 08:21.680
So this is where you've been!

08:22.050 --> 08:24.630
I wondered where you were! 
Why are you in here drinking?!

08:24.630 --> 08:27.110
This is my wife, Lina. You'll love her.

08:27.940 --> 08:29.470
Don't change the subject!

08:29.470 --> 08:32.270
You just accepted a quest, 
so let's get on it already!

08:32.270 --> 08:34.650
Um, my name is Cain.

08:34.650 --> 08:38.030
Claude saved me from some 
guys trying to pick a fight.

08:38.030 --> 08:41.250
Cain, eh? What a cutie!

08:41.250 --> 08:43.290
There are a lot of nasty folks around here,

08:43.290 --> 08:45.750
so if anything happens, you tell me, okay?

08:45.750 --> 08:48.380
I will. Thank you very much.

08:48.840 --> 08:52.870
Yeah, but, Lina, Cain's got some 
skills, despite how he looks.

08:53.190 --> 08:57.200
If I hadn't stopped him,
 the floor would be covered in blood.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.110
Excuse me!

08:58.550 --> 09:01.940
Keep drinking, and the floor's 
gonna be covered in <i>your</i> blood.

09:01.940 --> 09:03.030
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

09:03.030 --> 09:04.500
O-Okay, okay!

09:04.800 --> 09:06.340
See ya later, Cain!

09:06.340 --> 09:07.690
Bye now, Cain.

09:06.690 --> 09:08.370
Ow, ow, ow!

09:08.370 --> 09:10.480
That booze is coming out of 
your quest payout, you hear?

09:10.480 --> 09:11.810
What?!

09:11.810 --> 09:13.860
Thank you again!

09:13.860 --> 09:16.530
Sure! Find yourself a good quest!

09:18.490 --> 09:20.730
Quests for G-rankers...

09:21.060 --> 09:24.060
Cleaning and cargo transport for a shop, huh?

09:24.060 --> 09:26.810
With magic, that'd be a piece of cake...

09:29.630 --> 09:32.320
But I'd really rather not do that.

09:32.320 --> 09:35.800
I'd prefer one that has to 
do with defeating monsters...

09:37.010 --> 09:39.350
Getting rid of goblins 
in the eastern forest?!

09:39.350 --> 09:42.060
And the reward is per goblin 
defeated, with no upper limit?!

09:42.270 --> 09:44.730
This is it! My first quest...

09:44.730 --> 09:46.110
is right here!

09:48.060 --> 09:49.490
My first quest!

09:49.490 --> 09:52.020
Dear husband!

09:52.020 --> 09:54.090
Tijuana?! Why are you here?

09:54.520 --> 09:57.510
The order is training 
outside the capital today.

09:57.510 --> 09:58.760
What about you?

09:58.760 --> 10:02.030
I just registered as an adventurer, 
and I'm going on my first quest!

10:02.030 --> 10:05.600
I see! In that case, I'll go with you!

10:05.600 --> 10:06.960
What?!

10:06.960 --> 10:09.280
But, Captain, we have training—

10:09.280 --> 10:12.540
What wife would miss the start 
of her husband's new adventure?!

10:12.540 --> 10:15.040
As for the training, you can take charge.

10:15.040 --> 10:17.810
Let's go, my dear husband!

10:17.810 --> 10:20.180
Help me, Vice Captain!

10:20.180 --> 10:22.850
Sorry, Cain. I can't defy the captain.

10:22.850 --> 10:25.970
Oh, come on!

10:31.910 --> 10:34.440
So this is the forest 
mentioned in the quest...

10:35.790 --> 10:38.030
Alone in the forest with my dear husband...

10:38.030 --> 10:42.840
My heart feels so warm, even the 
roars of the monsters sound pleasant!

10:42.840 --> 10:44.450
Come! Come!

10:46.660 --> 10:48.770
Doesn't the breeze feel wonderful?

10:48.770 --> 10:51.770
Where are those goblins 
you need for the quest?

10:51.770 --> 10:52.910
<i>Search!</i>

10:55.300 --> 10:57.260
I'm picking up signs of 
goblins straight ahead.

10:57.630 --> 10:59.800
Okay! Straight ahead it is!

11:01.430 --> 11:03.170
Wait up!

11:03.170 --> 11:05.720
Chase me down, my dear husband!

11:12.180 --> 11:13.520
How awful.

11:13.970 --> 11:16.520
My Search indicated they'd be around here...

11:16.520 --> 11:18.110
Dear husband, look!

11:20.550 --> 11:21.400
Let's go!

11:23.790 --> 11:24.590
Dear husband!

11:24.590 --> 11:25.580
Heal!

11:29.020 --> 11:30.750
These beasts must be high-ranked.

11:31.170 --> 11:33.410
Leave this to me! I'll make an escape route!

11:35.130 --> 11:36.290
Tijuana!

11:42.220 --> 11:45.480
How'd you like that? 
My blade is cutting well today!

11:48.060 --> 11:49.890
Tijuana, it's okay.

11:50.120 --> 11:52.500
I'll cover you with my magic!

11:57.610 --> 12:01.010
Thank you! I'm filled with 
my dear husband's love!

12:02.150 --> 12:05.080
Now you and I are of one body and soul!

12:05.620 --> 12:09.260
Dear husband! I love you!

12:10.120 --> 12:11.200
Be it...

12:11.520 --> 12:13.120
in sickness...

12:13.120 --> 12:15.080
or in health...

12:15.080 --> 12:18.840
I swear to stay by your side!

12:19.110 --> 12:21.340
Now is the time for our first joint task!

12:21.780 --> 12:25.180
This blade is my vow of undying love!

12:25.590 --> 12:27.960
I will be with my dear husband forever!

12:27.960 --> 12:30.520
Time to cut the cake!

12:35.040 --> 12:37.710
Congratulations! Congratulations!

12:37.710 --> 12:39.750
Congratulations, Tijuana!

12:39.750 --> 12:43.680
Dear husband, praise me!

12:42.090 --> 12:46.290
Congratulations! Congratulations! 
Congratulations!

12:49.000 --> 12:50.160
Green lizards!

12:51.750 --> 12:54.060
Sheesh... It just never ends.

12:54.060 --> 12:56.100
Tijuana, take that man and run.

12:56.100 --> 12:57.060
But—

12:57.060 --> 12:58.890
Let me handle it this time.

12:58.890 --> 13:00.160
I'll be fine.

13:00.780 --> 13:01.760
All right.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.200
Come on, this way!

13:04.210 --> 13:05.070
Now, then...

13:05.070 --> 13:06.130
Light Ball!

13:07.840 --> 13:09.050
Now's my chance!

13:09.440 --> 13:11.010
Ice Pillar!

13:15.400 --> 13:17.140
What the heck was that?!

13:18.120 --> 13:20.920
My dear husband is just too much today!

13:20.920 --> 13:22.440
<b>Some Time Later</b>

13:22.800 --> 13:25.150
Wh-What is this giant hole?!

13:25.660 --> 13:30.370
The intel we got from the guild said 
the green lizards lived in this area

13:30.370 --> 13:33.430
but there's nothing here. 
Not a trace of them.

13:33.430 --> 13:35.370
I'm going home.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.620
Wait up!

13:37.620 --> 13:40.930
Nina! Nina!

13:41.130 --> 13:42.550
<b>And Now</b>

13:43.750 --> 13:45.850
Oh, Cain. What's the matter?

13:45.850 --> 13:49.090
Um, I defeated some green lizards.

13:49.090 --> 13:51.260
Does it still count if 
I didn't accept the quest?

13:51.260 --> 13:54.000
What? You defeated green lizards?!

13:54.000 --> 13:55.480
Should I not have?

13:55.480 --> 13:59.960
Well, quests for green lizards are meant 
for D-rankers if it's a single one,

13:59.960 --> 14:02.250
or C-rank if it's a group of them.

14:02.250 --> 14:05.240
Thank goodness you're all right. 
You were lucky.

14:05.460 --> 14:08.030
I took out about thirty of them...

14:08.030 --> 14:11.240
What?! Th-Thirty?!

14:11.240 --> 14:13.200
Chief! Chief!

14:13.200 --> 14:15.750
This incredible boy says he 
defeated thirty green lizards!

14:15.750 --> 14:18.450
What? Green lizards, you say?

14:18.450 --> 14:19.670
Yes!

14:20.660 --> 14:22.290
Bring him in here!

14:22.290 --> 14:23.440
Huh?

14:24.810 --> 14:29.760
I'm Cedric. The guild master is with 
a visitor, so I'm handling your case.

14:29.760 --> 14:32.470
Tell me honestly, Cain.

14:32.790 --> 14:35.180
Where did you get the green lizards?

14:35.180 --> 14:36.390
Huh?

14:36.390 --> 14:39.450
You're a G-rank who only 
just registered today.

14:39.450 --> 14:42.480
And you're just a kid! There's no 
way you could kill a green lizard!

14:42.480 --> 14:46.440
Chief, it's wrong to accuse him 
of cheating without any evidence!

14:46.710 --> 14:50.560
That's right. I've told you that 
I just defeated them like normal.

14:50.560 --> 14:53.910
I looked at the registry, 
and you're just a commoner.

14:53.910 --> 14:57.670
You talk big for a peasant trying to 
swindle the guild for reward money.

14:57.670 --> 14:59.880
It's unfair for you to just assume that!

14:59.880 --> 15:02.770
Shut up! Cheating must be severely punished!

15:02.770 --> 15:04.880
I'm revoking your guild card!

15:04.880 --> 15:07.050
Chief! That's an abuse of authority!

15:07.050 --> 15:08.840
Shut up!

15:08.840 --> 15:11.460
Cheating will <i>never</i> be tolerated!

15:11.460 --> 15:14.390
My decision won't change! 
We're done here! Get lost!

15:14.390 --> 15:16.330
Y-You can't...

15:16.330 --> 15:19.940
<i>I finally became an adventurer, 
and they're revoking it?!</i>

15:19.940 --> 15:21.850
What's all the fuss here?

15:22.130 --> 15:24.770
You're so loud, I can't 
even hold a conversation.

15:24.770 --> 15:26.250
Guild Master!

15:26.250 --> 15:29.380
I'm sorry, but this brat 
won't admit he cheated.

15:29.380 --> 15:31.680
I keep telling you, I didn't cheat!

15:31.680 --> 15:33.050
My goodness.

15:33.810 --> 15:34.950
You're...

15:39.090 --> 15:42.650
So how did you come to the 
conclusion that he cheated?

15:42.650 --> 15:46.810
I mean, c'mon! He claims he killed 
green lizards on the day he registered!

15:46.810 --> 15:48.390
Thirty of them, no less!

15:48.390 --> 15:50.260
It's obvious there's a scam going on here!

15:52.480 --> 15:53.180
Guild Master?

15:53.530 --> 15:55.160
Why are you laughing?!

15:55.160 --> 15:56.910
Cedric...

15:56.910 --> 16:00.340
You say there's no way a child like 
this could defeat green lizards?

16:00.820 --> 16:03.180
You've got a lot yet to learn.

16:03.850 --> 16:04.960
Guild Master...

16:04.960 --> 16:08.370
You'd believe a rotten little 
brat like this over me?!

16:08.370 --> 16:09.640
Rotten...

16:11.060 --> 16:12.740
Hey, come on in.

16:13.990 --> 16:15.010
Tijuana!

16:13.990 --> 16:15.010
The knight captain!

16:15.010 --> 16:15.700
Huh?

16:16.070 --> 16:18.090
My dear husband!

16:18.090 --> 16:19.960
What?! "Husband"?!

16:19.960 --> 16:20.830
I thought so.

16:20.830 --> 16:24.670
Tijuana, don't! 
Our engagement is still a secret!

16:24.670 --> 16:25.830
Engagement?!

16:27.210 --> 16:28.410
Oops...

16:28.410 --> 16:31.290
Wait, what are you doing here, anyway?!

16:31.610 --> 16:33.440
I actually came back to the guild after that

16:33.440 --> 16:37.630
to talk about countermeasures 
against goblins and green lizards.

16:37.630 --> 16:39.260
Exactly.

16:39.790 --> 16:41.890
Cain... no...

16:42.270 --> 16:43.390
Baron Cain.

16:43.390 --> 16:46.020
What?! Baron?!

16:46.340 --> 16:47.560
You hadn't heard

16:48.060 --> 16:52.490
about the hero who saved 
Princess Telestia and Miss Silk?

16:52.810 --> 16:55.390
Th-That was... this kid?!

16:55.390 --> 16:57.470
Yep. Baron Cain.

16:57.870 --> 17:00.660
A baron?! But the registry didn't...

17:01.120 --> 17:03.910
I didn't want to be treated 
like a noble here,

17:03.910 --> 17:06.300
so I registered as just "Cain."

17:06.300 --> 17:08.540
And Baron Cain is also

17:08.540 --> 17:11.380
a son of Margrave Garm.

17:11.380 --> 17:14.940
H-He's a son of Margrave Garm?!

17:14.940 --> 17:17.310
And if he marries Tijuana,

17:17.310 --> 17:19.510
he'll also be my brother-in-law.

17:19.510 --> 17:22.900
What?! You're Tijuana's brother?!

17:23.210 --> 17:24.930
That's what surprises you the most?

17:25.420 --> 17:30.080
Cedric, would you still call 
him a rotten little brat?

17:30.580 --> 17:33.360
I guess that would make 
me a rotten big brother.

17:35.050 --> 17:37.210
Master Cain! I'll be more careful!

17:37.210 --> 17:39.600
Please don't have me charged 
with insulting a noble!

17:39.600 --> 17:42.010
Tijuana, is insulting a noble a crime?

17:42.010 --> 17:45.270
The law says a commoner who 
insults nobility can be executed.

17:45.270 --> 17:48.750
E-Execution?! I'd never 
do anything that horrible!

17:49.130 --> 17:52.390
I accept your apology. 
Please raise your head.

17:52.390 --> 17:55.420
But please don't make any more 
unfounded assumptions, okay?

17:55.690 --> 17:57.710
Of course! Never again!

17:57.710 --> 18:01.770
Anyway, will the guild 
accept my green lizards?

18:01.770 --> 18:04.100
I have about thirty of them.

18:05.180 --> 18:07.320
We'll gladly accept them.

18:07.840 --> 18:08.470
Retia.

18:08.470 --> 18:11.080
Right. We'll put them 
in the storehouse later,

18:11.080 --> 18:13.070
and then they'll be dealt with.

18:13.070 --> 18:19.190
But for a G-ranked rookie to bring 
back thirty green lizards...

18:19.190 --> 18:22.010
We can't just leave things as they stand.

18:22.010 --> 18:23.540
To apologize for all this,

18:23.930 --> 18:26.200
I'll raise your rank to C.

18:26.200 --> 18:28.480
What? Really?!

18:28.480 --> 18:31.720
Come now, Brother! 
C-rank isn't nearly good enough!

18:31.720 --> 18:35.680
My husband defeated a 
red dragon at the age of ten!

18:35.680 --> 18:38.470
Besides, he's stronger than me!

18:38.760 --> 18:41.770
What?! He's stronger than 
the captain of the knights?!

18:41.770 --> 18:43.560
Does that make him the 
strongest in the kingdom?!

18:43.560 --> 18:44.890
Yep, that's right!

18:45.210 --> 18:46.720
Right, my dear husband?

18:47.000 --> 18:52.090
Hmm... No one can attain B-rank 
without subjugating some bandits,

18:52.090 --> 18:54.940
but I doubt anyone would complain 
if it was the hero, Baron Cain.

18:55.580 --> 18:57.530
Why don't I just put you at A-rank?

18:57.800 --> 19:00.710
What?! A-rank on his first day?!

19:00.710 --> 19:03.440
Oh, you'll need to subjugate 
those bandits, though.

19:03.440 --> 19:06.450
Is it okay if I just capture 
them and bring them in?

19:06.450 --> 19:08.390
Yes, that's fine.

19:08.390 --> 19:11.780
There are other quests the guild 
will directly assign to you, too,

19:11.780 --> 19:13.540
so you definitely deserve A-rank.

19:13.920 --> 19:16.250
Retia, Cedric, take care of the paperwork.

19:16.250 --> 19:17.840
R-Right!

19:20.330 --> 19:23.210
Baron Cain, as the guild master,

19:23.210 --> 19:25.970
I sincerely apologize for my 
subordinate's rude behavior.

19:25.970 --> 19:26.930
I'm sorry.

19:26.930 --> 19:30.330
Please, don't apologize. 
It doesn't matter now.

19:30.990 --> 19:32.030
Thank you.

19:32.540 --> 19:36.520
I was a bit surprised when I heard 
you were engaged to my sister...

19:37.210 --> 19:39.890
But after finally seeing you today, 
my mind's been put at ease.

19:40.740 --> 19:43.390
I know my little sister 
is a bit rambunctious,

19:43.390 --> 19:45.040
but please take care of her.

19:45.040 --> 19:48.190
Come on, Brother! What do 
you mean, "rambunctious"?

19:48.190 --> 19:50.750
I was only looking for a strong opponent.

19:50.750 --> 19:53.440
I bet you strong-armed him into 
getting engaged, didn't you?

19:53.440 --> 19:59.010
Please! My dear husband and I have already 
performed love's first joint task!

20:00.670 --> 20:03.750
That is the symbol of the love between us!

20:03.750 --> 20:06.310
Tijuana! Don't phrase it like that!

20:06.310 --> 20:09.460
You're gonna give your 
brother the wrong idea!

20:09.460 --> 20:10.810
Don't worry.

20:10.810 --> 20:15.190
I know my sister, and how she calls mock 
battles "dates," better than anyone.

20:15.590 --> 20:19.440
I'm so glad you're such an 
understanding older brother!

20:22.260 --> 20:23.860
He never changes, does he?

20:24.120 --> 20:26.130
He's caused another commotion.

20:26.130 --> 20:29.480
I really think giving him level 
10 protections was too much.

20:29.480 --> 20:33.540
It's fine. We need him to get even stronger.

20:33.540 --> 20:37.020
Do you have some reason for 
making him so powerful?

20:37.020 --> 20:41.300
Yes. Aaron's seal will soon be broken.

20:42.650 --> 20:43.760
Aaron?!

20:44.120 --> 20:47.600
If Aaron returns, the world 
will be in real trouble!

20:47.880 --> 20:54.230
Exactly. He was sealed 300 years ago, 
but who knows what will happen this time?

20:54.230 --> 20:58.190
In that case, we need him 
to get much stronger,

20:58.190 --> 21:02.390
or our world will lose all the prosperity 
it has at long last obtained!

21:02.390 --> 21:06.970
Yes, we must train him even more. But how?

21:07.350 --> 21:10.410
There is someone hidden away who 
could make a fine master for him.

21:11.220 --> 21:13.860
Ah, yes, the one you speak 
of would be perfect.

21:13.860 --> 21:16.250
Let's have the child train under him.

21:16.730 --> 21:17.850
Him...

21:21.020 --> 21:22.700
Gold!

22:56.120 --> 22:58.540
Let's finally study together today!

22:58.540 --> 23:01.150
Sure, we can do that, Teles, Silk.

23:01.150 --> 23:03.440
Yay! A study date!

23:03.440 --> 23:05.800
Please teach me lots of things!

23:05.800 --> 23:08.360
There you are, my dear husband!

23:08.590 --> 23:12.030
We had a forest date... 
so next we'll have a beach date!

23:12.380 --> 23:12.950
Gah!

23:12.950 --> 23:15.660
What is this about a "forest date"?

23:15.660 --> 23:19.290
You turned us down, but went 
on a date with Tijuana?

23:19.290 --> 23:20.870
Master Cain!

23:19.290 --> 23:20.870
Cain!

23:21.120 --> 23:23.210
You must give us a thorough lesson.

23:23.210 --> 23:25.040
Please do, Instructor Cain.

23:25.040 --> 23:28.280
U-Um, um... Y-You've got it all wrong!

23:28.280 --> 23:29.470
Grovel!

23:29.470 --> 23:31.680
Grovel!

23:34.990 --> 23:36.470
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.410 --> 23:36.970
Next time, "The Royal Academy."

23:36.810 --> 23:40.250
<b>"The Royal Academy"</b>

23:36.970 --> 23:39.950
Come to think of it, 
Claude reminds me of someone...
